WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:02.350
So...

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.730
Are you ready to do this?

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.020
Don't worry.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.740
This won't hurt.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.660
You're going to...

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:18.740
...suck my blood?

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.910
I'm not going to suck your blood.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.830
What are you going to do then?

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.290
I'm going to give you some poison.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:28.170
Poison?

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.550
Yes, poison.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:34.300
I'm going to give you some of my poison.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:39.560
And then you won't be 
able to ever leave me.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.810
Don't worry. This won't hurt.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:53.740
Here we go.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:00.870
Okay, all done!

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.370
You won't be able to leave me now.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:07.670
We'll be together in life and death.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.170
Are you ready?

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.550
I'm not ready yet...

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.720
But I already placed a curse on you.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.090
You are now my servant...

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:20.470
My protector...

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:22.390
My beloved...

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.680
I love you, Taito.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:28.310
This is all too sudden...

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.900
Don't mind that. Just 
tell me that you love me.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.110
That will complete the spell.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.570
Or are you saying that 
you don't like me?

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.450
That's not it...

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:41.660
So you like me?

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.290
Uh-huh...

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.160
Then say the words.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:47.410
Uh-huh... I...

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.750
I love you too, Himea...

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.590
In that moment,

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:03.140
I realized that the world, the very 
composition of my body had completely changed,

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.890
I had been placed under a curse...

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.230
I had been placed under a spell...

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.600
And so...

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.150
I love you, Taito.

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.740
And so, this was the 
beginning of my story...

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:21.870
Or so I thought...

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.240
Taito... Taito!

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:26.910
I...

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.500
Taito?

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.750
I love...

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.550
Taito! Hello, Taito!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.550
Come on!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.720
Come on now!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.930
Wake up already, Taito!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:43.100
Honestly, homeroom ended ages ago.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:48.100
"900 Seconds of After School <Part One>"

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.350
Hmm? Haruka? What's up?

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.680
Honestly, that's all you have to say?

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.650
You've been asleep since fifth period.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:53.770
The teacher couldn't wake 
you up when he tried.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.900
Whoa! Homeroom's over already!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.570
That's what I just said.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:00.070
Are you okay, Taito?

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.950
Damn, I overslept...

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.620
Ha-Haruka! Wh-What are you doing?!

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.790
Huh? Oh, there was drool on your face.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:17.880
Drool...?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:22.090
Uh, this isn't what you think...

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.510
I knew they were an item.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:28.020
Aw, Haruka was supposed to be my wife.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.850
Ha-Haruka, you realize 
that we're not, y'know?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.190
So you should stop doing that.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.560
Hmm? We're not what?

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.520
Uh, I shouldn't need to tell you.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:38.530
Hmm?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.030
Eh, whatever...

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:51.710
Seriously? You're still 
tired after all that sleep?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.580
What?

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.210
Are you feeling sick, Taito?

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.710
Not really. I'm fine.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.550
Does your leg still hurt?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:00.880
Don't feel a thing.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.090
But...

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.010
Oh, actually...

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:04.640
Hmm?

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:10.770
Lately I keep having the same dream.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.810
Huh? The same dream?

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.270
Uh-huh, that's right.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.650
What kind of dream?

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.270
I'm not going to tell you.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.270
You'll totally laugh at me.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:22.400
Huh? That's no fair. 
Now I want to know.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.490
Promise not to laugh?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.320
I promise.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.330
Really? Then I'll tell you.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:35.080
I'm a little kid again, and there's 
this girl who confesses her love to me.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.880
"I love you, Taito."

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.010
Huh? That's it?

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.510
That's your recurring dream?

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.640
You promised not to laugh!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.270
Sorry, I couldn't help myself.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.440
Sorry.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.560
Bah...

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.150
How old was I?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:06.110
Maybe the girl in my dream was you?

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:06.740
Huh?!

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.740
I-It couldn't be!

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:14.660
I still haven't confessed my love 
to you or anything like that...

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.290
True. I mean, that girl was super cute!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.630
What's that supposed to 
mean?! You're such a jerk!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.010
Sorry!

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.720
Omigod! It's Gekkou-sama!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.300
Gekkou-sama! Gekkou-sama! Over here!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:33.430
Gekkou-sama, are you off to 
do student council work?!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:41.020
Out of the way, trash.

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.570
Stay out of my sight.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.360
No fair! Say something to me, too!

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.120
Move it! Move it!

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:54.080
Hey, Gekkou. Can I use 
force to scatter this crowd?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.080
Don't do anything stupid, scum.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.210
I'm not scum!

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:02.380
Work hard, Gekkou-sama!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.090
A top student and star athlete

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.590
who's popular with the girls...

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:11.140
A superstar who was voted student council 
president in his first year at school...

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.600
Kurenai Gekkou-sama has 
graced us with his presence.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:18.270
Oh, you must be jealous of Kurenai-kun 
because he's so popular.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.350
Huh? I guess.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.900
Really... You want to be popular?

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.190
I'd be lying if I say that I didn't...

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.900
But I'm not a superman like him,

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.570
so I'll never be that popular.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.660
You'd rather go out with 
someone like him, right?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.750
Well, I wouldn't be so sure about that.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:38.910
What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.170
Hehe.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.590
Haruka's actually pretty cute.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.300
So why am I so...

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:48.840
Taito!

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.640
You are my servant.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.390
My protector.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.100
My beloved.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.970
I love you, Taito...

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.560
Taito?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.440
It's nothing. I just have a little 
headache because I slept too much.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:13.450
Hey, Haruka. Was he looking at me?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.580
Kurenai-kun?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.700
You were probably imagining things?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:21.330
Really? It felt like he 
was staring right at me.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.500
Whatever.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.630
I wonder what people like 
him usually think about.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:29.130
Yep. He's really something.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:33.840
Yeah, The complete opposite 
of me and my mediocre life.

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:36.140
You're not mediocre.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.680
Yeah, I am.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.180
You're not.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.520
I'm pretty sure I am.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.060
Okay. In that case...

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.400
What's wrong with being mediocre?

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:44.980
Huh?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:48.820
If you can go through life with a smile 
on your face every day, you've got it made.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:49.900
Right?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.240
You're right.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:53.450
Ah.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:58.330
I forgot! We have a 
tennis meeting today!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.660
Sorry, Taito! Can you 
wait until we're finished?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.000
Screw that.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.870
What? You're so mean!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:05.880
Let's go home together!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.590
Just get going!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.760
R-Right. Got it! Bye!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:10.840
Oh, Haruka!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:12.800
What?

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.340
Uh, well...

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:17.010
I guess there's nothing 
wrong with being mediocre.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.720
Right?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:22.770
Though that makes me sound like an old 
fart instead of someone in high school.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.520
Grandpa Taito! Look both ways 
when you cross the street!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.780
Mediocre, huh...

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.080
Karate Dojo

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.710
I did it!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.510
He shouldn't have any trouble walking.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.180
However, he should avoid 
any intensive activity.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:04.100
After the injury cost me 
everything I had worked for,

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.310
Haruka...

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.810
It's okay, Taito!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:09.610
Taito!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.690
...was always by my side 
with a smile on her face,

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.070
telling me that everything 
would be okay...

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.780
Taito!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.870
We ended up going 
to the same high school,

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.160
where I sit around doing 
nothing, and all she says is...

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.460
If you can go through life with a smile 
on your face every day, you've got it made.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.170
Oh, man...

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.090
I need to find something to do.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.550
Karate Dojo

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:37.800
Student Council

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.220
Kiss me!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.480
Geez! Just kiss me already, Gekkou!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.690
Shut up.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.190
What?! Shut up?!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.400
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.490
Hey, now! Are you listening to me?!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.820
Hurry up and kiss me!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.910
Hurry! Hurry!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.500
Or else I'll die!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.290
Come on, Gekkou!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.580
Whoa!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:09.330
There it is!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:12.670
I said to kiss me already!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:13.340
I'm going to die!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.880
I'm really going to die!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.010
I'll die! I'll die!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.180
Come on, Gekkou!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.510
Shut up, trash.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.560
Exorcise: Spell Error!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.650
Hmph, trash.

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:41.410
What are you doing, Gekkou?! 
That was dangerous!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:45.160
You need me to kiss you before you 
can deal with a weakling, trash?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.580
I'm not trash!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.290
Noisy trash, then.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.830
Geez! Come on...

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:53.340
Ah!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.050
I'm thirsty!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.050
I want some Dr Cinnamon!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.510
Can I go buy some?

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.800
Simpleton. Do as you wish.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.720
Yay! I'll buy some for you!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.980
Bye!

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.190
Oh, what do you want?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.400
A coke.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.400
Got it!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.980
Disgusting...

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.740
This report makes me...

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.410
...sick...

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:29.000
The Ancient Magician Saitohimea
The Victim Kurogane Taito
And Information Concerning Kurenai Gekkou

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.740
Sick to the stomach...

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.960
Dr Cinnamon! Dr Cinnamon!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.630
Tastes great but nobody likes it!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:44.390
Isn't that the girl who was 
with Kurenai Gekkou...?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.610
Wait!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:11:59.780
Run!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.160
Am I going to die...?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:09.790
Sorry...

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.330
Haruka...

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.240
Taito...

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.780
Why haven't you come...

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:51.410
Why haven't you come for me...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:52.250
...yet...

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:54.290
I've been...

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:57.540
I've been alone here forever...

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.340
Taito...

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.840
I'm so lonely...

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.130
Come quick...

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.850
One last chance...

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.890
I'll wait five minutes...

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:17.810
Will you come before then... maybe...?

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.360
...Taito?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:31.740
Taito...

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.500
Taito...

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.330
Taito...

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.130
Himea!

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.420
Himea!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.970
Taito said that he 
enjoyed being with me...

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.260
I was so happy, too...

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.850
...being with you...

00:13:54.430 --> 00:14:01.070
You were the only one who never tried 
to use me... Never wanted my power...

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.860
You said I was fun to be with...

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:06.610
Taito...

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.200
Taito... I want to see you...

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.750
If Taito's forgotten about me...

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.300
...but he's found happiness...

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.510
...then it doesn't matter...

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.810
No...

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:37.850
No...!

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.440
I was lying!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:43.570
Don't forget me!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.030
Don't forget about me, Taito...

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.330
Hey!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:01.210
Hey! You still alive?

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.380
Huh? Whoa!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:07.170
Whew... You're okay?

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.930
Wait! I can see your underwear!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:11.890
Huh?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.890
No way... Is that...

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:16.560
...me?!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.980
Whoa! Awesome! Why 
are you still alive?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.150
You're like the headless horseman?

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:24.940
Wait! First, tell me if that 
body over there is... me?

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:25.520
Uh-huh.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.740
I-I knew it...

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:28.030
Er.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:28.690
Ow!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:32.320
Whoa... You can still feel pain in 
your body when your head isn't connected?

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:33.870
Um, wh-whoa?!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.500
No way...

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.540
I can move...?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.540
What's this? What's making it move?

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:45.960
That's not the problem here!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.170
Ow!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:59.350
Are you one of those 
transformable robots?!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.140
That isn't how a normal person reacts!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.320
Mo-Mo—

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.780
Monster!

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.700
Ah! We have a hit-and-run!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.280
Quick! Take a picture!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.700
Huh? Look!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.410
C-Crap!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.130
Here! Over here!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.340
Yes!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:29.510
Whoa! Bye-bye, immortal guy!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.390
F-First, I need to fix my head!

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:35.470
Put my head back on!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.770
I-It's back on!

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:42.850
I'm okay now!

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:45.850
Yeah, the hell I am!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.660
I'm perfectly fine...

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:02.450
A-And my leg... I was able 
to run at full strength...

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.250
Wh-What is this?

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.380
Didn't I die?!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:10.500
What the hell is going on?!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.390
My power...

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.680
My power is coming back?

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:29.190
I see... Taito died for me...

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:32.820
Begone!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:49.750
Now...

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.420
Now I can finally finish...

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.300
...the 900-second spell...

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.840
Now remember me.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.800
Call my name.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:04.020
Then, finally, the rest of 
my power will return.

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.650
I love you, Taito!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.360
That... That voice was...

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.690
...from my dream... No...

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.360
I recognize that voice...

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:20.570
I met her a long time ago...

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.580
We'll be together in life and death.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.540
Her name is...

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.920
I love you, Taito!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.630
Himea...

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.840
That's right...

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.550
Saitohimea.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.930
Oh, Taito...

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:49.850
You remembered...

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.400
He'll be here very soon...

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:57.860
Er... I'm not dressed!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.200
I have to get changed!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:03.200
Um... My current body is 6-years-old...

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.870
Nine years have passed...

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.080
...so I should be fifteen?

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.480
Will Taito tell me that I look cute?

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.900
Well, if he doesn't tell me that 
I look cute, I'll kill him.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.160
Military

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.080
It's me.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:55.790
What?

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:01.510
Dammit! Dammit!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:02.510
Dammit!

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:04.760
This stinks!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:08.220
I've kept Himea waiting...

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.600
...for all of these years...

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.060
Himea!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.570
Himea!

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:27.200
I won't! I won't forget you!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.330
I'll come save you!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.370
Promise!

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.750
How... How could I forget about her?!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.830
Idiot!

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:48.680
M-My leg healed itself?!

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:52.310
I see... This is the 
power Himea gave me!

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:56.980
Himea...

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:58.610
I made a promise...

00:20:58.610 --> 00:20:59.730
To never let you go!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:01.820
To always protect you!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:06.030
In the park... The park where 
only we used to play together...

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:08.950
Himea... Himea!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.880
Wait for me, Himea!

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:42.190
Nothing's changed...

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.900
This place is always empty 
for some strange reason...

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.830
Himea...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:01.880
Wait... Why did I think that Himea 
would be waiting for me here?

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:17.270
Himea!

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:23.730
You're late! You took too 
long to come here, Taito!

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:29.950
Himea...

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:33.870
Five minutes later...

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:42.630
It's been nine years... I was 
going to wait five more minutes...

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:46.300
I said if you didn't come,
 I would kill you...

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:50.970
I've waited for such a long time...

00:22:52.390 --> 00:22:53.510
Such a long time...?

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:58.060
You waited nine years...?

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:01.400
Five minutes later... 
Five minutes later...?

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:03.190
Himea...

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:07.490
I'm sorry... I promised 
to come for you...

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:12.160
I've missed you so much...

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:13.660
...Taito!

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:20.580
Himea...

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.670
Sorry to keep you waiting...

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:32.260
You're here now, so I'll forgive you.

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:56.580
Our deeply intertwined 
fates and stories...

00:23:57.160 --> 00:24:01.870
...began to move towards 
their final destination.

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:12.510
Listen to me, scum.

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:15.010
I'm Kurenai Gekkou, president 
of the student council.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:18.060
And starting today,

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:20.730
you've all become my slaves for life.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:23.230
Get down on your knees and worship me.

00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:25.730
Be grateful that you have 
the fortune to serve me.

00:24:26.190 --> 00:24:28.650
For you stand before...

00:24:28.650 --> 00:24:31.150
...a genuine genius.

00:24:31.400 --> 00:24:34.490
Hmm? What? Is there a problem?

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:37.530
Anyone with a problem, 
get over here. I'll kill you.

00:24:35.240 --> 00:24:41.120
Next Time 
"900 Seconds of After School <Part Two>"

00:24:37.530 --> 00:24:39.750
Everyone else will be my slaves.
